The web page loads two third-party components that are NOT included in this repository;
scripts/fetch_web_deps.py downloads them (pinned version + SHA-256) into web/vendor/:
- Pyodide (Mozilla Public License 2.0), https://github.com/pyodide/pyodide
- pypdf (BSD-3-Clause), https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf

All sample invoices under demo/ and generated by tests/gen/ are synthetic test data
marked "测试样例 非真实发票" (test sample, not a real invoice). They use fictional
companies and invalid number ranges, carry no seals, and have no legal effect.
